Enter a concealed sniping stance, increasing your weapon's attack range and vision range by [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)], giving all incoming damage a [18%, 30%, 36%, 42%, 48% (TL1-5)] chance to miss you, and causing your Headshot, Volley and Called Shots to behave as if the target was marked.

Any non-instant, non-movement action will break concealment, but the increased range and vision and damage avoidance will persist for 3 turns, with the damage avoidance decreasing in power by 33% each turn.

This requires a bow to use, and cannot be used if there are foes in sight within range [9, 7, 6, 6, 5 (TL1-5)].
